35,2,1,talk,Mizuki,,"@Shizue, last year we barely spoke. In the shared house, we had no space to be alone. I need balance.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Shizue,,"@Mizuki, I found the separate rooms cost 8,000 yen more each. The all-in rate is fairer for the group.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Minato,,"@Jonathan, the inn baths open until midnight. But dinner is at six. I need to know if I can eat later.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
