39,2,1,talk,Midori,,"@Shizue, the offshore house is 5,400 yen a head. The valley inn is 17,000. The city is 12,000 to 20,000.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Midori, the city is expensive. But the shared house had no privacy. I need a middle ground.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Midori, the all-in rate means we pay the same. No one is out of pocket. That is what I want.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
